Check to make sure that you've got mozplugger installed.  If you do,
make sure that you have definitions in the mozpluggerrc file to
describe realplayer...\


While you're at it, you may want to look at the helixplayer
( http://www.helixplayer.org/ )
(which is the new version of realplayer).


